atly is the European Merchant of Record for AI, software and digital products.",[476,477,478],"blockquote",{},[472,479,480],{},[481,482,483],"strong",{},"Alpha — under active development. Every alpha release may include breaking changes. Pin exact versions during alpha.",[472,485,486,487,491],{},"Fluent adds checkout builders, subscription operations, customer bindings, and a webhook processing pipeline to ",[488,489,490],"code",{},"vatly\u002Fvatly-api-php",". You keep your database and framework. Fluent calls your storage contracts to save orders and subscriptions.",[493,494,496],"h2",{"id":495},"start-a-subscription","Start a subscription",[472,498,499,500,503],{},"Install the package using ",[501,502,174],"a",{"href":175},". This function creates a hosted checkout and returns the URL to send to the browser:",[505,506,511],"pre",{"className":507,"code":508,"language":509,"meta":510,"style":510},"language-php shiki shiki-themes material-theme-lighter material-theme material-theme-palenight","use Vatly\\Fluent\\CustomerProfile;\nuse Vatly\\Fluent\\Vatly;\n\nfunction subscriptionCheckout(string $apiKey, string $customerId, string $planId): string\n{\n    $vatly = Vatly::apiOnly($apiKey);\n    $checkout = $vatly->subscriptionBuilder(new CustomerProfile(vatlyId: $customerId))\n        ->toPlan($planId)\n        ->withRedirectUrlSuccess('https:\u002F\u002Fapp.example.com\u002Fbilling\u002Freturn')\n        ->withRedirectUrlCanceled('https:\u002F\u002Fapp.example.com\u002Fbilling\u002Fcanceled')\n        ->create();\n\n    return $checkout->links->checkoutUrl->href;\n}\n","php","",[488,512,513,541,559,566,615,621,650,694,710,731,750,761,766,795],{"__ignoreMap":510},[514,515,518,522,526,530,533,535,538],"span",{"class":516,"line":517},"line",1,[514,519,521],{"class":520},"sbssI","use",[514,523,525],{"class":524},"sTEyZ"," Vatly",[514,527,529],{"class":528},"sMK4o","\\",[514,531,532],{"class":524},"Fluent",[514,534,529],{"class":528},[514,536,537],{"class":524},"CustomerP