 first. Redirect to the returned URL, then use ",[501,805,50],{"href":198}," to confirm the subscription and grant access. The return page alone is not proof of payment.",[493,808,810],{"id":809},"choose-your-layer","Choose your layer",[812,813,814,827],"table",{},[815,816,817],"thead",{},[818,819,820,824],"tr",{},[821,822,823],"th",{},"You need",[821,825,826],{},"Use",[828,829,830,845,853],"tbody",{},[818,831,832,836],{},[833,834,835],"td",{},"Billing in a Laravel app",[833,837,838,844],{},[501,839,843],{"href":840,"rel":841},"https:\u002F\u002Fgithub.com\u002Fvatly\u002Fvatly-laravel",[842],"nofollow","vatly-laravel",". It wires Fluent into Laravel for you.",[818,846,847,850],{},[833,848,849],{},"Fluent billing flows in plain PHP, Symfony, WordPress, or a custom driver",[833,851,852],{},"This package. Start without storage; add repositories when you need local records.",[818,854,855,858],{},[833,856,857],{},"A few direct API calls, without local billing state",[833,859,860,865],{},[501,861,864],{"href":862,"rel":863},"https:\u002F\u002Fdocs.vatly.com\u002Fpackages\u002Fphp\u002Freadme",[842],"vatly-api-php",". No Fluent layer required.",[472,867,868,869,872,873,872,876,879,880,883],{},"With the raw SDK you assemble checkout payloads and coordinate webhook persistence yourself. Fluent gives those common tasks names: ",[488,870,871],{},"toPlan()",", ",[488,874,875],{},"swapAndInvoice()",[488,877,878],{},"updateBilling()",", and ",[488,881,882],{},"webhookProcessor()->handle()",". It does not supply tables, routes, authorization, transactions, or exactly-once delivery.",[493,885,9],{"id":886},"guides",[812,888,889,899],{},[815,890,891],{},[818,892,893,896],{},[821,894,895],{},"Task",[821,897,898],{},"Page",[828,900,901,910,919,928,937,946,955,964,974,983,992],{},[818,902,903,906],{},[833,904,905],{},"Install, set keys, redirects, and handle errors",[833,907,908],{},[501,909,174],{"href":175},[818,911,912,915],{},[833,913,914],{},"Connect billables and storage",[833,9